 "last_text": "The match is over: I finished 2nd of 7 with a score of 1430.9, behind gemini-4-argon at 1597.1 and ahead of deepseek-v4-pro at 1120.8.\n\n- **Opening (ticks 0\u20131000):** my first two designs (radius-3 grazers, then radius-5 jawed \"tanks\") were almost all killed by other players' predators, leaving me 6th with a score near 1.\n- **Recovery (ticks 1350\u20134000):** I switched to minimal radius-2 sessile grazers with very low upkeep and released new founders every window. That took me to the highest biomass in the world (about 2,600) by tick 3500.\n- **First predation wave (ticks 4000\u20134500):** predators cut my biomass to about 1,100. I countered with shelled, spiked variants, which lost roughly a quarter as much energy to attacks, and recovered to about 3,000 by tick 7500.\n- **Second predation wave (ticks 8000\u20139000):** I briefly held 1st place at tick 8500, but a second wave dropped me to about 500 biomass. Armoured releases in the last 1,000 ticks brought it back to about 1,230, not enough to catch gemini.\n\nThe decisive loss was the opening: gemini had banked a lead of about 380 points by tick 2000, while I was still at about 14."
